[gcode_macro NOZZLE_POOP]
description: Macro to purge nozzle, then push the extruded filament off the X-min edge of the bed.
gcode:
    {% set cool_time = params.COOL_TIME|default(7500)|int %}

### Positioning Toolhead ###

    M117 Getting ready...
    RESPOND PREFIX=⏱️ MSG="Getting ready..."
    G92 E0                         # Reset extruder
    G90                            # Absolute positioning
    G1 E4.0 F3600                  # Fill nozzle
    G1 Z20 F3000                   # Move nozzle away from bed
    #G1 X70 Y172 Z5.0 F5000.0       # Move to start position
    G1 X5 Y185 Z5.0 F5000.0        # Move to start position (rear utility row — same Y band as CLEAN_NOZZLE's brush at Y184.075 — close to the X-min edge)
    G1 Z0.0 F5000.0                # Move nozzle to bed

### Purging Filament ###

    M117 Pooping...
    RESPOND PREFIX=💩 MSG="Pooping"
    G1 Z3 E10 F60                  # Start slow, to create a good base on the bed
    G1 Z7 E50 F30                  # Continue rising and extruding
    G91                            # Relative positioning
    G1 E-1 F1200                   # Quick retract to relieve pressure
    G90                            # Back to absolute
    G1 Z8 F600                     # Detach cleanly
    M106 S255                      # Turn on PCF
    {% if cool_time > 0 %}
        G4 P{cool_time}            # Cool dwell (7.5 seconds default)
    {% endif %}
    M106 S0                        # Turn off PCF

### Pushing purge off the X-min edge ###

    M117 Pushing waste off the edge...
    RESPOND PREFIX=🧹 MSG="Cleaning up after purge"
    # Push axis is X (blob built at X105/Y185, off the bed's X-min edge). PC fan duct
    # is offset 26mm laterally in X from nozzle center — duct_X = nozzle_X - 26 (same
    # relationship the old Y-axis push used: nozzle X128 aligned the duct with a blob
    # at X105). That puts the duct 26mm toward -X of the nozzle, i.e. already leading
    # on the side we're pushing toward — no Y offset needed, Y stays 185 throughout.
    # Push-align: nozzle X131 puts the duct at the blob's X105.
    # Push-end: nozzle X27 puts the duct at X1 (NOT nozzle X1 itself — that would put
    # the duct at X1-26 = -25, past position_min:0 and into the hard stop).
    G1 X131 Y185 F2000              # Position duct-offset align, clear of the blob
    G1 X131 Y185 Z0.4 F3000         # Lower to plow height
    G1 X27 Y185 Z0.4 F3000          # Push blob off the X-min edge (duct reaches X1)
    G91                             # Relative positioning
    G1 Z4.6 F1000                   # Move nozzle away from bed
    G90                             # Back to absolute
    G92 E0                          # Reset again after purge

### Confirmation of purge completion ###

    M117 ✅ Purge complete
    RESPOND PREFIX=✅ MSG="Nozzle purge complete"
